OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA chilly start across the
OL,6,Fnorth, but another fine and dry day
OL,7,Ffor many. Skies will turn hazy from
OL,8,Fthe south during the afternoon.
OL,9,FFeeling warm, but with gusty winds
OL,10,Facross the south and west.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FDry for most with clear
OL,13,Fspells. However, cloud will gradually
OL,14,Fincrease across the south, bringing an
OL,15,Fincreasing chance of showers by dawn,
OL,16,Fperhaps accompanied by the odd rumble
OL,17,Fof thunder.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
