OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CTuesday:FCloudy across southern areas
OL,6,Fwith sporadic showers, some becoming
OL,7,Fheavy and thundery from late
OL,8,Fafternoon. Elsewhere, most places will
OL,9,Fstay dry with hazy sunshine. Feeling
OL,10,Fincreasingly humid for all.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
